      "overview_title": "Product Overview",
      "overview": "The SYKON S60 is a 60 mm aluminium casement system built on aluminium composite profiles with EPDM gasket sealing.\n\nThe system covers casement windows in both inward and outward opening configurations, hinged doors, concealed sash configurations and co-planar door configurations — a single profile family across the full range of residential and commercial openings.\n\nSeven frame options, five sash options and a full set of transom, mullion and threshold profiles allow the system to be detailed consistently from a small window to an entrance door without leaving the family.",
